# Healing Salve's shield of 3 is on Bot1's attacking Guerrilla Gorilla, which Bot2 blocks with Preacher of the Schism (2,
# deathtouch) and its own Guerrilla Gorilla (2): 4 damage from two sources at once. "If damage would be dealt to the
# shielded permanent or player by two or more applicable sources at the same time, the player or the controller of the
# permanent chooses which damage the shield prevents" (CR 615.7): Bot1 has it prevent the Preacher's 2 first, then 1 of
# the Gorilla's. The Preacher deals no damage, so its deathtouch does nothing (CR 702.2b), and Bot1's Gorilla lives with 1
# damage. The other choice is healing-salve-shield-on-a-double-blocked-creature-its-controller-chooses-the-other-damage.

